    selector = EconomicRegimeFeatureSelector()

New:
    from src.training.steps.market_analysis.regime_feature_selector import EnhancedRegimeFeatureSelector
    selector = EnhancedRegimeFeatureSelector()
    
    # For unsupervised (pre-clustering)
    result = selector.select_features(
        features_df=features,
        regime_labels=None,      # No labels needed!
        use_supervised=False
    )

DEPRECATED: 2025-10-28
REASON: Circular dependency and optimization mismatch
FILE KEPT FOR REFERENCE ONLY - DO NOT USE IN PRODUCTION

For details, see:
- REGIME_FEATURE_SELECTION_ANALYSIS.md
- REGIME_FEATURE_SELECTION_FIX_SUMMARY.md
"""

